<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Applebee's as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Applebee's as hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said analyst Janice Meyer initiated coverage of Applebee's International Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3/8 to 27-1/4 in late morning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
